LIMITED PERMISSION FOR SECURITY AUDIT

Where a copy of this repository (or a snapshot derived from it) has been
supplied to a named reviewer for the purpose of a security or code audit, that
reviewer is permitted, for the duration of the engagement only, to:

  (a) store and read the supplied copy;
  (b) run it locally for the purpose of the review; and
  (c) report findings to the copyright holder.

That permission does not extend to redistribution, publication, disclosure to
third parties, or any production or commercial use. On completion of the
engagement the reviewer shall delete the supplied copy on request.

